# LazyVim's own internal bookkeeping (news-read marker, schema version) —
# rewritten by nvim itself with no user intent behind the value, so tracking
# it causes cross-machine clobbering instead of useful sync. If you want to
# sync enabled :LazyExtras again later, do it deliberately, not via this file.
editor/.config/nvim/lazyvim.json
